      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789223038615,
      "created": 1789222676744,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. item_cost = 6000\n\n- 6 month plan -> 6000 / 6 = 1000\nafter we pay the item amount\n4500 - 1000= 3500 (new_monthy_left)\nand it is very comfortable plan \n6 month plan\ninstead of paying one month\nwe recommend 6 months plan because \nyou have enough money left\n\nif you have savings of 2k\nyou can use savings and \nget it \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. item_cost = 6000\n\n- 6 month plan -> 6000 / 6 = 1000\nafter we pay the item amount\n4500 - 1000= 3500 (new_monthy_left)\nand it is very comfortable plan \n6 month plan\ninstead of paying one month\nwe recommend 6 months plan because \nyou have enough money left\n\nif you have savings of 2k\nyou can use savings and \nget it \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
